{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — a drop-in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationContentExtension"},{"type":"text","text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to your memory-constrained extension process.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Usage","anchor":"Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In your Notification Content Extension:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_STORIES"},{"type":"text","text":" (must match "},{"code":"aps.category","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"text":" = e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.5"},{"type":"text","text":" (keep in sync with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController"},{"text":" (code-only, no storyboard)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Payload","text":"Payload"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stories are described by a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pw_stories"},{"text":" block, alongside an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"type":"text","text":". The parser accepts the block either at"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"text":") or inside the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"custom-data container ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"code":"data","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field — delivered as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ios_root_params","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), the same block arrives nested under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"text":" — while ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mutable-content"},{"type":"text","text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through "},{"code":"ios_root_params.aps","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and old pushes keep rendering."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"text":" is optional. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"link"},{"text":" (like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"text":") must include a URL","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Analytics","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Analytics"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate","isActive":true},{"text":" to observe lifecycle and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache","type":"heading","text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Notification "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Service","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"App Groups","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extensions, and override ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From the Service Extension’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)"},{"type":"text","text":", call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher\/prefetch(userInfo:appGroupIdentifier:completion:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Send the push with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mutable-content: 1"},{"text":" so the Service Extension runs.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without this, the module still works — images download on display instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"PushwooshNotificationUI","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"PushwooshNotificationUI","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshNotificationUI"}],"role":"collection"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A ready-made full-screen “stories” UI for an expanded push notification."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Stories UI","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"]},{"title":"Payload model","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/StoryPage"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate"],"title":"Analytics"},{"title":"Media pre-cache","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/documentation/PushwooshNotificationUI/PushwooshStoriesViewController/storiesDelegate":{"title":"storiesDelegate","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"storiesDelegate"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:23PushwooshNotificationUI0A15StoriesDelegateP","text":"PushwooshStoriesDelegate"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional observer for story lifecycle \/ analytics events. Every method is optional —"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implement only the callbacks you need (impressions, clicks, completion, fallback).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":